nc-fixer-insider-name = John "Insider" Doe
nc-fixer-insider-desc = One anonymous journalist, or several. Runs an underground outlet that exposes corps and city hall with open sources, leaks and a private network of insiders; lately also the dirty secrets of medtech and research giants. Never shows a face: works through the Net, rarely through go-betweens. Always hungry for new material and pays well for names, blueprints and facts.
nc-fixer-insider-greeting-1 = > CONNECTION ENCRYPTED. "Got something for me? Names, schematics, anything that makes them sweat."
nc-fixer-insider-greeting-2 = > RELAY 7 OF 12. "The public deserves to know. And you deserve to get paid."
nc-fixer-insider-greeting-3 = > SIGNAL SCRAMBLED. "Don't look for me. Look for the truth, then send it my way."
nc-fixer-vlad-name = Vladimir "Vlad" Grigoriev
nc-fixer-vlad-desc = An emigrant and former member of an Eastern European crime ring, rumoured to have been convicted back home for trafficking. Fled to Night City and dug in at a dock in the port. Before the Time of the Red he built a network of buyers and runners supplying wholesale clients with guns and drugs. The Fourth Corporate War cost him his sea routes and his smuggler's clout, so now he lives off old stock: dope, fencing and storing stolen goods, finding and moving supplies around the city.
nc-fixer-vlad-greeting-1 = "Privet, choom. Work is there, money is there. Questions — not there."
nc-fixer-vlad-greeting-2 = "Port is quiet today. Quiet is good for business. You want business?"
nc-fixer-vlad-greeting-3 = "Vlad remembers who pays and who does not. Better you are the first kind."

nc-fixer-mission-insider-leak = The leak
nc-fixer-mission-insider-leak-desc = A source of mine left a shard at a quiet spot and went dark. Pick it up and put it in my drop.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-tyger-names = Who pays the Claws
nc-fixer-mission-insider-tyger-names-desc = The Tyger Claws keep a list of everyone paying them for protection on a terminal. Crack it and bring me the names.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-maelstrom-names = Maelstrom's buyers
nc-fixer-mission-insider-maelstrom-names-desc = Somebody respectable buys chrome from Maelstrom. Their terminal knows who. So will I.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-arrests = Arrest records
nc-fixer-mission-insider-arrests-desc = NCPD buries arrests that embarrass the right people. Get into a precinct terminal and pull the records.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-militech-ops = Militech operations
nc-fixer-mission-insider-militech-ops-desc = Militech is planning something off the books. Crack a terminal at one of their sites and copy the operation files.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-biotech-trials = Clinical trials
nc-fixer-mission-insider-biotech-trials-desc = Biotechnica tests drugs on people who never signed anything. The trial data sits on a terminal at their site.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-biotech-lab = The lab's dirty secret
nc-fixer-mission-insider-biotech-lab-desc = A Biotechnica lab hides research that would end careers. Security is heavy. The story is worth it.
nc-fixer-mission-insider-corporate-pda = Someone's PDA
nc-fixer-mission-insider-corporate-pda-desc = A corp employee carries their whole work life in a PDA. Bring it to my drop and I'll take it from there.

nc-fixer-mission-vlad-push = Push the product
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-push-desc = Take the brick. Buyer waits at drop point. You leave it, you go. Simple.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-push-maelstrom = Delivery for Maelstrom
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-push-maelstrom-desc = Maelstrom wants product. They pay well, they shoot fast. Leave the brick at the drop and do not make them nervous.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-guns = Iron for a client
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-guns-desc = Client needs four Streetmasters. Where you find — not my problem. Put them in my drop.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-ammo = Ammunition
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-ammo-desc = Six magazines of nine millimetre. Full ones. Into my drop.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-dope = Party supplies
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-dope-desc = Ten doses of euphoric. Street quality is fine, my clients are not picky.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-meds = Medicine for resale
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-meds-desc = Ten doses of trauma painkiller. Hospitals have, Vlad needs. Into my drop.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-debtor = Debt collection
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-debtor-desc = This man owes Vlad. Find him, beat him well. Alive. Dead men do not pay.
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-debtor-valentinos = Debtor under protection
nc-fixer-mission-vlad-debtor-valentinos-desc = My debtor runs to Valentinos and thinks he is safe. Show him he is wrong. Alive, and do not start a war.

